{
  "about": "Messages a device sends, and the events scripts are raised for them (docs/design/midi-input-and-mpe.md). Read by CE/web/test/midiInDecoder.test.js for the panel view's decoder and by CE/tests/MidiInDecoderTests.cpp for the plug-in's. Each step is { at, role, bytes } for a message, { at, flush: true } for the time going by, or { listen: role, opts } for ce.mpe.listen (opts null stops). `events` is every event the case raises, in order.",
